        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Euclides — Boekbeschouwing</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    color: #080808;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 768px;\n    height: 1013px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .left-column,\n  .right-column {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n  }\n  .left-column {\n    left: 55px;\n    width: 317px;\n  }\n  .right-column {\n    left: 407px;\n    width: 321px;\n  }\n  .dot {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 49px;\n    left: 1px;\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 17px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #000;\n  }\n  .top-equation {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 96px;\n    left: 15px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .intro {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 153px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 317px;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 17.7px;\n    letter-spacing: -.08px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .hidden-description {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 1px;\n    height: 1px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .portrait {\n    top: 236px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 317px;\n    height: 351px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(ellipse at 58% 30%, #d4d4d4 0 4%, #737373 5% 8%, transparent 9%),\n      radial-gradient(ellipse at 58% 44%, #bcbcbc 0 7%, #353535 8% 14%, transparent 15%),\n      radial-gradient(ellipse at 42% 69%, #9a9a9a 0 11%, #252525 12% 24%, transparent 25%),\n      radial-gradient(ellipse at 67% 76%, #777 0 7%, #181818 8% 17%, transparent 18%),\n      linear-gradient(155deg, #050505 0 37%, #272727 38% 52%, #090909 53% 100%);\n    border: 1px solid #555;\n  }\n  .portrait::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    opacity: .28;\n    background-image:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(17deg, transparent 0 3px, #fff 4px, transparent 5px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(103deg, transparent 0 9px, #aaa 10px, transparent 11px);\n    mix-blend-mode: screen;\n  }\n  .portrait-caption {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 611px;\n    left: 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .lower-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 659px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 317px;\n    font-size: 15.4px;\n    line-height: 17.5px;\n    letter-spacing: -.06px;\n  }\n  .lower-left p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .equation-row {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    min-height: 52px;\n    margin-top: 7px;\n  }\n  .equation-row .formula {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 14px;\n    top: 1px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .equation-row .number {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 1px;\n    top: 20px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 925px;\n    left: 16px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    word-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .footer em {\n    margin-left: 13px;\n    margin-right: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .diagram {\n    top: 48px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 321px;\n    height: 184px;\n  }\n  .diagram svg {\n    display: block;\n    width: 321px;\n    height: 184px;\n  }\n  .figure-caption {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 244px;\n    left: 2px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .right-text {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 276px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 321px;\n    font-size: 15.4px;\n    line-height: 17.55px;\n    letter-spacing: -.08px;\n  }\n  .right-text p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    padding-left: 16px;\n  }\n  .display-equation {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 54px;\n    margin: 6px 0 3px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .display-equation .eqno {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 4px;\n    top: 21px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  .small-equation {\n    margin: 6px 0 5px 12px;\n    min-height: 51px;\n    text-align: left;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .sum-equation {\n    min-height: 42px;\n    margin: 5px 0 0 11px;\n    text-align: left;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n  }\n  .final-equation {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  mjx-container[display=\"true\"] {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <section class=\"left-column\">\n    <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"top-equation\">\n      $\\displaystyle \\frac{-2b^{2}c^{2}}{y^{2}}-\\frac{2bc^{2}}{y}-2by+2vy=0$\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"intro\">\n      Deze vergelijking heeft een wortel <i>y</i><sub>0</sub>. Substitueer <i>y</i><sub>0</sub><br>\n      voor <i>y</i>, los <i>v</i> op en het middelpunt (0, −<i>v</i>) van de<br>\n      cirkel is bekend. Daarmee is ook de normaal ge-<br>\n      vonden.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder portrait\">\n      <span class=\"hidden-description\">[Photo: portrait of Johannes Hudde]</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"portrait-caption\">Johannes Hudde, ca. 1628-1704</div>\n\n    <div class=\"lower-left\">\n      <p>\n        Een nieuw probleem is het volgende. Gegeven een<br>\n        algebraïsche kromme <i>K</i> (figuur 2) met vergelijking<br>\n        <i>f</i>(<i>x</i>,<i>y</i>) = 0 en twee punten <i>M</i> en <i>N</i> op deze<br>\n        kromme. Gevraagd de lengte van de boog <i>MN</i>.<br>\n        (Van Heuraet)<br>\n        <i>P</i> is een punt op boog <i>MN</i> (zie de figuur). De lengte<br>\n        van de normaal <i>PS</i> kan berekend worden met de<br>\n        hierboven geschetste methode. Verder is een wille-<br>\n        keurig lijnstuk gekozen met lengte $\\sigma$. Een nieuwe<br>\n        kromme <i>K′</i> wordt gedefinieerd door middel van\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"equation-row\">\n        <div class=\"formula\">$\\displaystyle \\frac{P'R}{\\sigma}=\\frac{PS}{PR}$</div>\n        <div class=\"number\">(1)</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">266 <em>Euclides</em> Boekbeschouwing</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"right-column\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder diagram\">\n      <span class=\"hidden-description\">[Diagram: construction for rectification, top-right]</span>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 321 184\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Geometrical diagram\">\n        <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#090909\" stroke-width=\"1.35\">\n          <path d=\"M1 159.5 L319 159.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M27 159 L27 53\"/>\n          <path d=\"M47 63 C62 102,92 128,130 125 C163 122,194 100,228 74 C244 62,258 52,271 43\"/>\n          <path d=\"M58 64 C74 95,98 110,131 111 C165 112,191 98,224 79 C244 67,258 59,270 52\" stroke-dasharray=\"11 7\"/>\n          <path d=\"M48 5 C52 18,59 35,72 51\" stroke-dasharray=\"11 7\"/>\n          <path d=\"M47 18 L69 68\"/>\n          <path d=\"M74 80 L74 159\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/>\n          <path d=\"M175 91 L175 159\"/>\n          <path d=\"M194 79 L194 159\"/>\n          <path d=\"M233 69 L233 159\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 3\"/>\n          <path d=\"M175 91 L194 159\"/>\n          <path d=\"M175 91 L208 91\"/>\n          <path d=\"M208 91 L208 124\"/>\n          <path d=\"M175 124 L208 124\"/>\n          <path d=\"M175 91 L175 124\"/>\n          <path d=\"M260 123 L310 123 L310 105 Z\"/>\n          <path d=\"M269 40 L198 88\"/>\n          <path d=\"M108 53 L108 26\"/>\n          <path d=\"M108 27 L104 34 M108 27 L112 34\"/>\n          <path d=\"M108 43 L128 43\"/>\n          <path d=\"M128 43 L122 39 M128 43 L122 47\"/>\n        </g>\n\n        <g font-family=\"Times New Roman, serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#000\">\n          <text x=\"41\" y=\"31\">K′</text>\n          <text x=\"17\" y=\"94\">σ</text>\n          <text x=\"40\" y=\"94\">K</text>\n          <text x=\"70\" y=\"70\">M″</text>\n          <text x=\"75\" y=\"103\">M</text>\n          <text x=\"66\" y=\"170\">M′</text>\n\n          <text x=\"168\" y=\"89\">P′</text>\n          <text x=\"172\" y=\"109\">P</text>\n          <text x=\"145\" y=\"132\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"171\" y=\"170\">R</text>\n          <text x=\"190\" y=\"170\">S</text>\n\n          <text x=\"227\" y=\"62\">N″</text>\n          <text x=\"227\" y=\"171\">N′</text>\n          <text x=\"236\" y=\"91\">N</text>\n\n          <text x=\"203\" y=\"106\">C</text>\n          <text x=\"204\" y=\"135\">B</text>\n\n          <text x=\"92\" y=\"43\">y,y′</text>\n          <text x=\"119\" y=\"55\">x</text>\n\n          <text x=\"277\" y=\"148\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"305\" y=\"146\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"311\" y=\"103\">C</text>\n          <text x=\"277\" y=\"122\">Δs</text>\n          <text x=\"281\" y=\"144\">Δx</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"figure-caption\">figuur 2</div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-text\">\n      <p>\n        We brengen nu het probleem van de rectificatie van<br>\n        <i>K</i> terug tot de kwadratuur van <i>K′</i> door te bewijzen<br>\n        dat\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">\n        $\\sigma$ · lengte boog <i>MN</i> = opp. <i>M′M″N″N′</i>\n      </p>\n      <p>\n        Dit geschiedt als volgt. Teken de raaklijn <i>AC</i> in <i>P</i><br>\n        aan <i>K</i>. Teken $\\triangle ABC$ en noem <i>AB</i> = $\\Delta x$ en<br>\n        <i>AC</i> = $\\Delta s$. Nu is $\\triangle ABC \\sim \\triangle PRS$ en dus\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"display-equation\">\n        $$\\frac{PS}{PR}=\\frac{AC}{AB}=\\frac{\\Delta s}{\\Delta x}$$\n        <span class=\"eqno\">(2)</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>Uit (1) en (2) volgt</p>\n      <div class=\"small-equation\">\n        $$\\frac{P'R}{\\sigma}=\\frac{\\Delta s}{\\Delta x}$$\n      </div>\n\n      <p>en dus</p>\n      <p class=\"indent\">$\\sigma\\Delta s=P'R\\cdot\\Delta x$</p>\n      <p>\n        Kies op <i>K</i> een serie consecutieve punten tussen <i>M</i><br>\n        en <i>N</i>. Laat <i>P</i> zo’n serie punten doorlopen. Somma-<br>\n        tie geeft dan\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"sum-equation\">\n        $$\\sum_P \\sigma\\Delta s=\\sum_P P'R\\cdot\\Delta x$$\n      </div>\n\n      <p>of</p>\n\n      <div class=\"sum-equation\">\n        $$\\sigma\\sum_P \\Delta s=\\sum_P P'R\\cdot\\Delta x$$\n      </div>\n\n      <p>\n        Limietovergang levert<br>\n        <span class=\"indent final-equation\">$\\sigma$ · lengte boog <i>MN</i> = opp. <i>M′M″N″N′</i></span><br>\n        Om te laten zien dat deze methode ook praktisch<br>\n        uitvoerbaar is, geeft Van Heuraet als voorbeeld de<br>\n        kromme <i>K</i> met vergelijking $y^2=\\dfrac{x^3}{a}$.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
